#. translators: %s: number of seconds, e.g. 4.2.
msgid "%s seconds (from banner shown to the visitor’s choice)."
msgstr ""
"%s soicind (ón uair a thaispeántar an meirge go dtí rogha an chuairteora)."

msgid ""
"A small icon-only button that lets visitors reopen the cookie settings after"
" they have made a choice. It is automatically hidden while the banner or "
"preferences dialog is open."
msgstr ""
"Cnaipe beag le deilbhín amháin a ligeann do chuairteoirí socruithe na "
"bhfianán a athoscailt tar éis dóibh rogha a dhéanamh. Cuirtear i bhfolach go"
" huathoibríoch é fad atá an meirge nó dialóg na sainroghanna ar oscailt."

msgid "About"
msgstr "Maidir le"

msgid "About Lynbro Cookie Consent"
msgstr "Maidir le Lynbro Cookie Consent"

msgid "Accept all"
msgstr "Glac le gach ceann"

msgid "Accept button"
msgstr "Cnaipe glactha"

msgid "Accept rate"
msgstr "Ráta glactha"

msgid "Accessible label"
msgstr "Lipéad inrochtana"

msgid "Add a custom language"
msgstr "Cuir teanga shaincheaptha leis"

msgid ""
"Add a small language dropdown to the banner so visitors can switch language "
"manually (their choice is remembered)."
msgstr ""
"Cuir roghchlár beag anuas teanga leis an meirge ionas gur féidir le "
"cuairteoirí an teanga a athrú de láimh (cuimhneofar ar a rogha)."

msgid "Add your privacy policy link"
msgstr "Cuir nasc le do pholasaí príobháideachais leis"

msgid "Additional CSS"
msgstr "CSS breise"

msgid ""
"Allow the website to remember choices you make (such as language or region) "
"to provide enhanced, personalized features."
msgstr ""
"Lig don suíomh gréasáin cuimhneamh ar na roghanna a dhéanann tú (amhail "
"teanga nó réigiún) chun gnéithe feabhsaithe pearsantaithe a chur ar fáil."

msgid "Already downloaded on demand:"
msgstr "Íoslódáilte ar éileamh cheana:"

msgid "Always allow %s"
msgstr "Ceadaigh %s i gcónaí"

msgid "Always on"
msgstr "Ar siúl i gcónaí"

msgid "Android"
msgstr "Android"

msgid "Anonymous statistics"
msgstr "Staitisticí anaithnide"

msgid "Auto (follow visitor’s system)"
msgstr "Uathoibríoch (de réir chóras an chuairteora)"

msgid "Auto by region"
msgstr "Uathoibríoch de réir réigiúin"

msgid "Auto by region (EU opt-in, US opt-out, rest by choice)"
msgstr ""
"Uathoibríoch de réir réigiúin (roghnú isteach san AE, roghnú amach sna Stáit"
" Aontaithe, an chuid eile de réir rogha)"

msgid ""
"Auto uses the light colors by default and the dark colors when the visitor’s"
" device prefers a dark color scheme."
msgstr ""
"Úsáideann an mód uathoibríoch na dathanna geala de réir réamhshocraithe agus"
" na dathanna dorcha nuair is fearr le gléas an chuairteora scéim dathanna "
"dorcha."

msgid "Auto-block trackers"
msgstr "Cuir bac go huathoibríoch ar lorgairí"

msgid "Auto-detect visitor language"
msgstr "Braith teanga an chuairteora go huathoibríoch"

msgid "Automatic tracker blocking"
msgstr "Blocáil uathoibríoch rianairí"

msgid ""
"Automatically block known third-party trackers (Google Analytics, GTM, Meta "
"Pixel, Hotjar, Clarity, and more) until the matching category is granted."
msgstr ""
"Cuir bac go huathoibríoch ar rianairí aitheanta ó thríú páirtithe (Google "
"Analytics, GTM, Meta Pixel, Hotjar, Clarity, agus eile) go dtí go dtugtar "
"cead don chatagóir chomhfhreagrach."

msgid ""
"Automatically show the banner in the visitor’s browser language when it is "
"one of the offered languages."
msgstr ""
"Taispeáin an mheirge go huathoibríoch i dteanga bhrabhsálaí an chuairteora "
"nuair atá sí ar cheann de na teangacha a thairgtear."

msgid "Average time to decision"
msgstr "Meán-am go dtí cinneadh"

msgid "Background color"
msgstr "Dath cúlra"

msgid "Banner background"
msgstr "Cúlra na meirge"

msgid "Banner description"
msgstr "Cur síos na meirge"

msgid "Banner max width (px)"
msgstr "Uasleithead na meirge (px)"

msgid "Banner shown"
msgstr "Meirge taispeánta"

msgid "Banner text on background"
msgstr "Téacs na meirge ar an gcúlra"

msgid "Banner title"
msgstr "Teideal na meirge"

msgid ""
"Base z-index for the banner, overlay, modal and floating button. Increase it"
" if another element covers the banner; lower it if the banner covers "
"something it should not."
msgstr ""
"Bun-z-index don mheirge, don fhorleagan, don mhódal agus don chnaipe ar "
"snámh. Méadaigh é má chlúdaíonn eilimint eile an mheirge; ísligh é má "
"chlúdaíonn an mheirge rud nár cheart don mheirge a chlúdach."

msgid ""
"Basic HTML allowed: links, bold, italic, line breaks. Leave empty for the "
"translated default."
msgstr ""
"Ceadaítear HTML bunúsach: naisc, cló trom, cló iodálach, bristí líne. Fág "
"folamh é chun an réamhshocrú aistrithe a úsáid."

msgid "Benchmark sharing"
msgstr "Comhroinnt tagarmharcála"

msgid ""
"Benchmark sharing is on. Your first comparison will appear here after the "
"weekly report has run."
msgstr ""
"Tá comhroinnt tagarmharcála cumasaithe. Beidh do chéad chomparáid le "
"feiceáil anseo tar éis don tuarascáil sheachtainiúil rith."

msgid ""
"Block embedded content (YouTube, Vimeo, Google Maps, social embeds, "
"reCAPTCHA, and more) until consent, showing a tidy placeholder with an "
"\"allow\" button."
msgstr ""
"Cuir bac ar inneachar leabaithe (YouTube, Vimeo, Google Maps, leabuithe "
"sóisialta, reCAPTCHA, agus eile) go dtí go dtugtar toiliú, agus taispeáin "
"áitshealbhóir néata le cnaipe \"ceadaigh\"."

msgid "Blocking & Embeds"
msgstr "Blocáil agus leabuithe"

