msgstr "Deilbhín an chnaipe"

msgid "Button text"
msgstr "Téacs an chnaipe"

msgid "Button text on Accept button"
msgstr "Téacs ar an gcnaipe Glac"

msgid "Button text on Reject button"
msgstr "Téacs ar an gcnaipe Diúltaigh"

msgid "CCPA / CPRA opt-out link"
msgstr "Nasc rogha diúltaithe CCPA / CPRA"

msgid "Categories"
msgstr "Catagóirí"

msgid "Category"
msgstr "Catagóir"

msgid "Category “%s” — description"
msgstr "Catagóir “%s” — tuairisc"

msgid "Category “%s” — name"
msgstr "Catagóir “%s” — ainm"

msgid "Center modal (with overlay)"
msgstr "Módal sa lár (le forleagan)"

msgid "Choose language"
msgstr "Roghnaigh teanga"

msgid ""
"Collect anonymous statistics (how many visitors accept, reject or open "
"preferences). Fully aggregated and cookieless — no IP address or personal "
"data is stored. Shown in the Statistics tab."
msgstr ""
"Bailigh staitisticí gan ainm (cé mhéad cuairteoir a ghlacann, a dhiúltaíonn "
"nó a osclaíonn na sainroghanna). Go hiomlán comhiomlánaithe agus gan fianáin"
" — ní stóráiltear aon seoladh IP ná sonraí pearsanta. Taispeántar iad sa "
"chluaisín Staitisticí."

msgid ""
"Comma-separated page/post IDs where the banner should not be shown (e.g. "
"landing pages)."
msgstr ""
"Aitheantais leathanaigh/postálacha, scartha le camóga, nach dtaispeánfar an "
"meirge orthu (m.sh. leathanaigh tuirlingthe)."

msgid ""
"Configure your GDPR/ePrivacy and Google Consent Mode v2 cookie banner. This "
"plugin helps with compliance but does not constitute legal advice."
msgstr ""
"Cumraigh do mheirge thoilithe fianán le haghaidh GDPR/ePrivacy agus Google "
"Consent Mode v2. Cabhraíonn an breiseán seo le comhlíonadh, ach ní comhairle"
" dlí atá ann."

