msgstr "Ionadchoinneálaithe le haghaidh leabuithe"

msgid ""
"Embeds are unblocked when the visitor grants this category (or clicks "
"\"allow\" on the placeholder)."
msgstr ""
"Baintear an bac de leabuithe nuair a thugann an cuairteoir toiliú don "
"chatagóir seo (nó nuair a chliceáiltear \"ceadaigh\" ar an "
"ionadchoinneálaí)."

msgid "Enable Google Consent Mode v2 signals"
msgstr "Cumasaigh comharthaí Google Consent Mode v2"

msgid "Enable this category"
msgstr "Cumasaigh an chatagóir seo"

msgid "Engagement (last 30 days)"
msgstr "Rannpháirtíocht (30 lá anuas)"

msgid ""
"Enjoying Lynbro Cookie Consent? A short, honest review helps other site "
"owners find it. No pressure — only if you have a minute."
msgstr ""
"An dtaitníonn Lynbro Cookie Consent leat? Cabhraíonn léirmheas gearr macánta"
" le húinéirí suíomhanna eile é a aimsiú. Gan aon bhrú — más féidir leat "
"nóiméad a spáráil."

msgid ""
"Enter a WordPress locale code (for example pt_PT or ca) to offer a language "
"that is not bundled. After saving, fill in its texts below."
msgstr ""
"Cuir isteach cód logchaighdeáin WordPress (mar shampla pt_PT nó ca) chun "
"teanga nach bhfuil san áireamh a thairiscint. Tar éis duit é a shábháil, "
"líon isteach na téacsanna di thíos."

msgid "Exclude pages/posts"
msgstr "Leathanaigh/ailt a eisiamh"

msgid "Export CSV"
msgstr "CSV a easpórtáil"

msgid "Export settings"
msgstr "Socruithe a easpórtáil"

