msgstr "Mód dlíthiúil"

msgid "Light"
msgstr "Éadrom"

msgid "Light colors"
msgstr "Dathanna éadroma"

msgid "Linux"
msgstr "Linux"

msgid "Live preview (updates as you change Design and General settings):"
msgstr ""
"Réamhamharc beo (nuashonraítear é de réir mar a athraíonn tú na socruithe "
"Dearaidh agus Ginearálta):"

msgid "Load content from %s"
msgstr "Luchtaigh ábhar ó %s"

msgid "Local consent log"
msgstr "Loga toilithe áitiúil"

msgid "Low contrast (%s:1). Aim for at least 4.5:1 to meet WCAG AA."
msgstr ""
"Codarsnacht íseal (%s:1). Dírigh ar 4.5:1 ar a laghad chun WCAG AA a "
"chomhlíonadh."

msgid ""
"Lynbro Cookie Consent is a free, privacy-first cookie banner built by "
"Lynbro. Our goal is a beautiful, genuinely multilingual, GDPR/ePrivacy-ready"
" banner with an equal Reject button — and no pageview limits, no paywall on "
"the essentials, and no front-end tracking."
msgstr ""
"Is meirge fianán saor in aisce é Lynbro Cookie Consent, tógtha ag Lynbro, a "
"chuireann an príobháideachas chun tosaigh. Is é an sprioc atá againn meirge "
"álainn, fíor-ilteangach, réidh do GDPR/ePrivacy a chur ar fáil, le cnaipe "
"Diúltaigh ar chomhchéim — agus gan teorainneacha ar amharcanna leathanaigh, "
"gan balla íocaíochta ar na bunriachtanais, agus gan aon rianú ar an taobh "
"tosaigh."

msgid "Manage opened"
msgstr "Osclaíodh an painéal bainistithe"

msgid "Manage preferences"
msgstr "Bainistigh sainroghanna"

msgid "Manage-preferences button"
msgstr "Cnaipe “Bainistigh sainroghanna”"

msgid "Marketing"
msgstr "Margaíocht"

msgid ""
"Maximum width of the floating box and center modal. Set 0 to use the "
"default."
msgstr ""
"An leithead uasta don bhosca ar snámh agus don mhódal láir. Socraigh 0 chun "
"an réamhshocrú a úsáid."

msgid "Message"
msgstr "Teachtaireacht"

msgid "Method"
msgstr "Modh"

msgid "Mobile"
msgstr "Soghluaiste"

msgid "Necessary"
msgstr "Riachtanach"

msgid ""
"Necessary cookies are always active and cannot be disabled. Choose which "
"optional categories visitors can control."
msgstr ""
"Bíonn fianáin riachtanacha gníomhach i gcónaí agus ní féidir iad a "
"dhíchumasú. Roghnaigh cé na catagóirí roghnacha is féidir le cuairteoirí a "
"rialú."

msgid ""
"Need a language that is not bundled? Request it and we will generate it for "
"your site. The translation file is stored in your uploads folder (never "
"overwritten on update) and activated automatically."
msgstr ""
"An bhfuil teanga uait nach bhfuil san áireamh? Iarr í agus ginfimid í do do "
"shuíomh. Stóráiltear an comhad aistriúcháin i d’fhillteán uaslódálacha (ní "
"fhorscríobhtar riamh é le linn nuashonraithe) agus cuirtear i ngníomh go "
"huathoibríoch é."

msgid "No consent records yet."
msgstr "Níl aon taifid toilithe ann fós."

msgid "No data yet."
msgstr "Níl aon sonraí ann fós."

msgid "No file was uploaded."
msgstr "Níor uaslódáladh aon chomhad."

msgid "No thanks, don’t show this again"
msgstr "Níl, go raibh maith agat, ná taispeáin é seo arís"

msgid "Notice only"
msgstr "Fógra amháin"

msgid "Off"
msgstr "Múchta"

msgid "Offered languages"
msgstr "Teangacha ar fáil"

msgid "Offset from corner (px)"
msgstr "Fritháireamh ón gcúinne (px)"

msgid "On"
msgstr "Ar siúl"

msgid "Once Weekly"
msgstr "Uair sa tseachtain"

msgid "Only if you would like a reply. Leave empty to send anonymously."
msgstr ""
"Ná líon isteach é ach amháin más mian leat freagra. Fág folamh é le seoladh "
"gan ainm."

msgid "Opacity"
msgstr "Teimhneacht"

msgid "Operating systems"
msgstr "Córais oibriúcháin"

msgid "Opt-in everywhere"
msgstr "Rogha isteach i ngach áit"

msgid "Opt-in everywhere (GDPR — safest)"
msgstr "Rogha isteach i ngach áit (GDPR — an rogha is sábháilte)"

msgid "Opt-out everywhere"
msgstr "Rogha an diúltaithe i ngach áit"

msgid "Opt-out everywhere (CCPA style)"
msgstr "Rogha an diúltaithe i ngach áit (stíl CCPA)"

msgid ""
"Optional CSS appended to the banner stylesheet. Target the .lynbro-cc "
"selectors."
msgstr ""
"CSS roghnach a chuirtear le stílbhileog an mheirge. Dírigh ar na roghnóirí "
".lynbro-cc."

msgid "Other"
msgstr "Eile"

msgid ""
"Override any banner text for a specific language. Leave a field empty to use"
" the bundled translation (or the English default). Priority: your override →"
" bundled translation → default."
msgstr ""
"Sáraigh aon téacs ar an meirge do theanga ar leith. Fág réimse folamh chun "
"an t-aistriúchán ionsuite a úsáid (nó an réamhshocrú Béarla). Tosaíocht: do "
"leagan saincheaptha → aistriúchán ionsuite → réamhshocrú."

msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Forbhreathnú"

msgid "Period"
msgstr "Tréimhse"

msgid "Please choose a valid language code."
msgstr "Roghnaigh cód teanga bailí, le do thoil."

msgid "Please enter a message before sending."
msgstr "Cuir teachtaireacht isteach sula seolfaidh tú í, le do thoil."

msgid "Please upload a .json settings file."
msgstr "Uaslódáil comhad socruithe .json, le do thoil."

msgid "Plugin home page"
msgstr "Leathanach baile an bhreiseáin"

msgid "Policy URL"
msgstr "URL an pholasaí"

msgid "Policy version"
msgstr "Leagan an pholasaí"

msgid "Position"
msgstr "Suíomh"

msgid "Preferences"
msgstr "Sainroghanna"

msgid "Privacy Policy & Terms"
msgstr "Polasaí Príobháideachais & Téarmaí"

msgid "Privacy/Cookie policy URL"
msgstr "URL an pholasaí príobháideachais/fianán"

msgid ""
"Private, cookieless statistics stored only in your own database. They are "
"fully aggregated — no IP address, no visitor identifier and no personal data"
" is ever recorded. Because of that, these statistics do not by themselves "
"require consent."
msgstr ""
"Staitisticí príobháideacha gan fianáin, a stóráiltear i do bhunachar sonraí "
"féin amháin. Déantar iad a chomhiomlánú go hiomlán — ní thaifeadtar seoladh "
"IP, aitheantóir cuairteora ná aon sonraí pearsanta riamh. Dá bhrí sin, ní "
"éilíonn na staitisticí seo toiliú astu féin."

msgid "Read more"
msgstr "Léigh tuilleadh"

msgid "Recent consent records"
msgstr "Taifid toilithe le déanaí"

msgid ""
"Records older than this are deleted automatically. Set to 0 to keep records "
"indefinitely."
msgstr ""
"Scriostar taifid níos sine ná seo go huathoibríoch. Socraigh go 0 chun "
"taifid a choinneáil gan teorainn."

msgid "Region"
msgstr "Réigiún"

msgid ""
"Region is detected from CDN/edge headers (e.g. Cloudflare). When unknown, "
"the safest opt-in model is used. No external geolocation API is called."
msgstr ""
"Aimsítear an réigiún ó cheanntásca CDN/imeall (m.sh. Cloudflare). Nuair nach"
" eol é, úsáidtear an tsamhail toilithe roimh ré is sábháilte. Ní dhéantar "
"glao ar aon API geoshuímh seachtrach."

msgid ""
"Register as the consent provider for the WP Consent API plugin and notify "
"other plugins of the visitor’s choice (functional, preferences, statistics, "
"marketing)."
msgstr ""
"Cláraigh mar sholáthraí toilithe don bhreiseán WP Consent API agus cuir "
"breiseáin eile ar an eolas faoi rogha an chuairteora (feidhmiúil, "
"sainroghanna, staitisticí, margaíocht)."

msgid "Reject all"
msgstr "Diúltaigh do gach ceann"

msgid "Reject button"
msgstr "Cnaipe diúltaithe"

msgid "Report a bug"
msgstr "Tuairiscigh fabht"

msgid "Request a language"
msgstr "Iarr teanga"

msgid "Request this language"
msgstr "Iarr an teanga seo"

msgid ""
"Required for the website to function and cannot be switched off. They are "
"usually set in response to actions you make, such as setting privacy "
"preferences or logging in."
msgstr ""
"Tá siad riachtanach le go bhfeidhmeoidh an suíomh gréasáin agus ní féidir "
"iad a mhúchadh. De ghnáth, socraítear iad mar fhreagairt ar ghníomhartha a "
"dhéanann tú, amhail sainroghanna príobháideachais a shocrú nó logáil "
"isteach."

msgid ""
"Resting transparency (0.2–1.0). The button becomes fully opaque on hover or "
"focus. Default is 0.55."
msgstr ""
"Trédhearcacht i staid scíthe (0.2–1.0). Éiríonn an cnaipe go hiomlán "
"teimhneach nuair atá an cúrsóir os a chionn nó nuair atá fócas air. Is é "
"0.55 an réamhshocrú."

msgid "Retention (days)"
msgstr "Coinneáil (laethanta)"

msgid "Round"
msgstr "Cruinn"

msgid "Rounded"
msgstr "Slánaithe"

msgid ""
"Rounding of the banner, box and modal corners. Set 0 to use the default."
msgstr ""
"Slánú choirnéil an mheirgí, an bhosca agus an mhódail. Socraigh 0 chun an "
"réamhshocrú a úsáid."

msgid "Save language settings"
msgstr "Sábháil socruithe teanga"

msgid "Save preferences"
msgstr "Sábháil sainroghanna"

msgid "Save-preferences button"
msgstr "Cnaipe Sábháil sainroghanna"

msgid "Send feedback"
msgstr "Seol aiseolas"

#. translators: %s: link to the portal privacy/terms page.
msgid ""
"Sends only the plugin name, version and language code to the Lynbro portal. "
"See our %s."
msgstr ""
"Ní sheolann sé ach ainm an bhreiseáin, an leagan agus an cód teanga chuig "
"tairseach Lynbro. Féach ar ár %s."

msgid "Set"
msgstr "Socraigh"

msgid ""
"Sets all consent signals to \"denied\" by default before consent, then "
"updates them based on the visitor’s choice (ad_storage, analytics_storage, "
"ad_user_data, ad_personalization, functionality_storage, "
"personalization_storage, security_storage)."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn sé gach comhartha toilithe go \"denied\" de réir réamhshocraithe "
"roimh thoiliú, agus ansin nuashonraíonn sé iad bunaithe ar rogha an "
"chuairteora (ad_storage, analytics_storage, ad_user_data, "
"ad_personalization, functionality_storage, personalization_storage, "
"security_storage)."

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "Socruithe"

msgid "Settings imported successfully."
msgstr "Iompórtáladh na socruithe go rathúil."

msgid "Shape"
msgstr "Cruth"

msgid ""
"Share anonymous statistics to help improve the plugin — and see how your "
"accept rate compares to the average. Off by default. Sends only aggregated "
"numbers and your site domain (never visitor IPs) to the Lynbro portal, once "
"a week."
msgstr ""
"Comhroinn staitisticí gan ainm chun cabhrú leis an mbreiseán a fheabhsú — "
"agus féach conas a sheasann do ráta glactha i gcomparáid leis an meán. As de"
" réir réamhshocraithe. Ní sheolann sé ach uimhreacha comhiomlánaithe agus "
"fearann do shuímh (ní sheoltar seoltaí IP cuairteoirí riamh) chuig tairseach"
" Lynbro, uair sa tseachtain."

msgid ""
"Show a \"Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information\" link in opt-out "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"Taispeáin nasc “Ná díol ná roinn mo chuid faisnéise pearsanta” sa mhód rogha"
" an diúltaithe."

msgid "Show floating settings button on the site"
msgstr "Taispeáin cnaipe socruithe ar snámh ar an suíomh"

msgid "Show language switcher"
msgstr "Taispeáin roghnóir teanga"

msgid ""
"Show the cookie icon (recommended). When off, the accessible label is shown "
"as a small text button instead."
msgstr ""
"Taispeáin an deilbhín fianán (molta). Nuair atá sé múchta, taispeántar an "
"lipéad inrochtana mar chnaipe beag téacs ina áit."

msgid "Size (px)"
msgstr "Méid (px)"

msgid ""
"Sorry, that language could not be fetched right now. Please try again later."
msgstr ""
"Ár leithscéal, ní fhéadfaí an teanga sin a fháil faoi láthair. Déan iarracht"
" eile níos déanaí."

msgid "Sorry, the message could not be sent. Please try again later."
msgstr ""
"Ár leithscéal, ní fhéadfaí an teachtaireacht a sheoladh. Déan iarracht eile "
"níos déanaí."

msgid "Square"
msgstr "Cearnógach"

msgid "Stacking (z-index base)"
msgstr "Cruachadh (bonn z-index)"

msgid "Statistics"
msgstr "Staitisticí"

msgid ""
"Statistics are currently turned off. Enable “Collect anonymous statistics” "
"in the General tab to start collecting aggregated numbers."
msgstr ""
"Tá staitisticí múchta faoi láthair. Cumasaigh “Bailigh staitisticí "
"anaithnide” sa chluaisín Ginearálta chun tosú ar uimhreacha comhiomlánaithe "
"a bhailiú."

msgid "Statistics are disabled."
msgstr "Tá staitisticí díchumasaithe."

msgid ""
"Store a privacy-respecting proof of consent in your own database. No raw IP "
"address is stored — only a salted, anonymised hash for de-duplication."
msgstr ""
"Stóráil cruthúnas ar thoiliú a thugann meas ar phríobháideachas i do "
"bhunachar sonraí féin. Ní stóráiltear aon seoladh IP amh — ní stóráiltear "
"ach hais shaillte, anaithnidithe le haghaidh dí-dhúblála."

msgid "Tablet"
msgstr "Táibléad"

msgid "Tell us what you think, what is missing, or what went wrong…"
msgstr "Inis dúinn do bharúil, cad atá in easnamh, nó cad a chuaigh mícheart…"

msgid "Text color"
msgstr "Dath an téacs"

msgid "Thank you! Your message was sent."
msgstr "Go raibh maith agat! Seoladh do theachtaireacht."

#. translators: %s: the average accept rate across opted-in sites.
msgid ""
"The average accept rate across opted-in sites is %s%%. Yours will show here "
"once visitors start choosing."
msgstr ""
"Is é %s%% an meánráta glactha ar fud na suíomhanna a ghlac páirt. "
"Taispeánfar do ráta féin anseo nuair a thosóidh cuairteoirí ag roghnú."

msgid ""
"The banner language follows a cache-safe cascade: the current page language "
"(Polylang/WPML/TranslatePress), then your site language, then English. "
"Browser auto-detection and the optional in-banner switcher happen entirely "
"in the visitor’s browser, so your page cache is never affected."
msgstr ""
"Leanann teanga an mheirgí ord cúltais atá sábháilte don taisce: teanga "
"reatha an leathanaigh (Polylang/WPML/TranslatePress), ansin teanga do "
"shuímh, ansin Béarla. Tarlaíonn uathbhraith an bhrabhsálaí agus an lascóir "
"roghnach sa mheirge go hiomlán i mbrabhsálaí an chuairteora, mar sin ní "
"bhíonn aon tionchar riamh ar thaisce do leathanaigh."

msgid "The file does not contain valid Lynbro Cookie Consent settings."
msgstr "Níl socruithe bailí Lynbro Cookie Consent sa chomhad seo."

msgid "Theme"
msgstr "Téama"

msgid ""
"These are the languages prepared for browser auto-detection and the "
"switcher. Languages with a bundled translation appear here automatically. "
"Your site language is always included."
msgstr ""
"Seo iad na teangacha atá ullmhaithe do bhrath uathoibríoch an bhrabhsálaí "
"agus don mhalartóir teanga. Taispeántar anseo go huathoibríoch teangacha a "
"bhfuil aistriúchán cuachta acu. Cuirtear teanga do shuímh san áireamh i "
"gcónaí."

msgid ""
"This complements manual script marking. All detection is local; no external "
"request is made."
msgstr ""
"Comhlánaíonn sé seo marcáil scripteanna de láimh. Déantar an bhrath go "
"háitiúil; ní dhéantar aon iarratas seachtrach."

msgid ""
"This plugin helps with cookie compliance but does not constitute legal "
"advice."
msgstr ""
"Cuidíonn an breiseán seo le comhlíonadh maidir le fianáin, ach ní comhairle "
"dlí é."

msgid ""
"Tip: cookie/consent wording can have legal implications. Have the legal "
"parts of any translation reviewed by a person familiar with your "
"jurisdiction."
msgstr ""
"Leid: d’fhéadfadh impleachtaí dlí a bheith ag baint le foclaíocht maidir le "
"fianáin/toiliú. Iarr ar dhuine atá eolach ar do dhlínse athbhreithniú a "
"dhéanamh ar na codanna dlí d’aon aistriúchán."

msgid ""
"To view this content from %s, you need to accept the relevant cookies. The "
"provider may set cookies and collect personal data."
msgstr ""
"Chun an t-ábhar seo ó %s a fheiceáil, ní mór duit glacadh leis na fianáin "
"ábhartha. Féadfaidh an soláthraí fianáin a shocrú agus sonraí pearsanta a "
"bhailiú."

msgid "Today"
msgstr "Inniu"

msgid "Too many requests."
msgstr "An iomarca iarratas."

msgid "Tools"
msgstr "Uirlisí"

msgid "Top bar"
msgstr "Barra uachtarach"

msgid "Top left"
msgstr "Barr ar chlé"

msgid "Top right"
msgstr "Barr ar dheis"

#. translators: %d: total number of consent records.
msgid "Total records: %d (showing the 50 most recent)."
msgstr "Líon iomlán na dtaifead: %d (na 50 is déanaí á dtaispeáint)."

msgid ""
"Unchecking this hides the floating button completely — visitors will not see"
" a way to reopen their cookie settings (unless you add the "
"[lynbro_cookie_settings] shortcode somewhere)."
msgstr ""
"Má dhíthiceáiltear é seo, cuirfear an cnaipe ar snámh i bhfolach go hiomlán "
"— ní fheicfidh cuairteoirí aon bhealach chun a socruithe fianán a oscailt "
"arís (mura gcuireann tú an gearrchód [lynbro_cookie_settings] áit éigin)."

msgid "Updates"
msgstr "Nuashonruithe"

msgid ""
"Updates are delivered automatically through WordPress.org — there is no "
"custom updater and the free version never phones home."
msgstr ""
"Seachadtar nuashonruithe go huathoibríoch trí WordPress.org — níl aon "
"nuashonraitheoir saincheaptha ann agus ní dhéanann an leagan saor in aisce "
"“glaoch abhaile” riamh."

msgid ""
"Used as the tooltip and screen-reader label. Leave empty for the translated "
"default."
msgstr ""
"Úsáidtear é mar an leid uirlise agus mar lipéad léitheora scáileáin. Fág "
"folamh é don réamhshocrú aistrithe."

msgid "Used only when Position is \"Floating box\"."
msgstr "Ní úsáidtear é ach nuair is \"Bosca snámhach\" an Suíomh."

msgid ""
"Used to track visitors across websites to display relevant advertising and "
"measure campaign effectiveness."
msgstr ""
"Úsáidtear é chun cuairteoirí a rianú ar fud suíomhanna gréasáin chun "
"fógraíocht ábhartha a thaispeáint agus éifeachtacht feachtas a thomhas."

msgid "Version & updates"
msgstr "Leagan agus nuashonruithe"

msgid "Vertical"
msgstr "Ingearach"

msgid "View changelog"
msgstr "Féach ar loga na n-athruithe"

msgid "Visibility"
msgstr "Infheictheacht"

msgid "Visit Lynbro"
msgstr "Tabhair cuairt ar Lynbro"

msgid "WP Consent API"
msgstr "API Toilithe WP"

msgid ""
"We detected a Global Privacy Control signal and automatically opted you out "
"of non-essential cookies."
msgstr ""
"Bhraith muid comhartha Rialaithe Príobháideachais Dhomhanda agus diúltaíodh "
"go huathoibríoch d’fhianáin neamhriachtanacha ar do shon."

msgid ""
"We use cookies to enhance your browsing experience, serve personalized "
"content and analyze our traffic. You can accept all cookies, reject non-"
"essential ones, or manage your preferences."
msgstr ""
"Úsáidimid fianáin chun d’eispéireas brabhsála a fheabhsú, ábhar "
"pearsantaithe a chur ar fáil agus ár dtrácht a anailísiú. Is féidir leat "
"glacadh le gach fianán, na cinn neamhriachtanacha a dhiúltú, nó do "
"shainroghanna a bhainistiú."

msgid "We value your privacy"
msgstr "Is mór againn do phríobháideachas"

msgid "Width and height of the button (24–96). Default is 40."
msgstr "Leithead agus airde an chnaipe (24–96). Is é 40 an réamhshocrú."

msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

msgid "Write a review"
msgstr "Scríobh léirmheas"

msgid "Yesterday"
msgstr "Inné"

msgid "You can still block your own scripts manually:"
msgstr "Is féidir leat do chuid scripteanna féin a bhlocáil de láimh fós:"

msgid "You do not have sufficient permissions to access this page."
msgstr ""
"Níl ceadanna leordhóthanacha agat chun rochtain a fháil ar an leathanach "
"seo."

#. translators: 1: this site's accept rate, 2: the average accept rate across
#. opted-in sites.
msgid ""
"Your accept rate over the last 7 days is %1$s%%. The average across opted-in"
" sites is %2$s%%."
msgstr ""
"Is é do ráta glactha le 7 lá anuas ná %1$s%%. Is é an meán ar fud na "
"suíomhanna a roghnaigh páirt a ghlacadh ná %2$s%%."

msgid "Your consent banner is live"
msgstr "Tá do mheirge toilithe i bhfeidhm"

msgid "Your email (optional)"
msgstr "Do ríomhphost (roghnach)"

#. translators: %s: link to the portal privacy/terms page.
msgid ""
"Your message, the plugin version and your site domain are sent to the Lynbro"
" portal. See our %s."
msgstr ""
"Seoltar do theachtaireacht, leagan an bhreiseáin agus fearann do shuímh "
"chuig tairseach Lynbro. Féach ar ár %s."

msgid "\"Read more\" link"
msgstr "Nasc \"Léigh tuilleadh\""

msgid "iOS"
msgstr "iOS"

msgid "macOS"
msgstr "macOS"

msgid "site language"
msgstr "teanga an tsuímh"

msgid ""
"Preparing your language… This can take about a minute the first time. It "
"will be added automatically — you can keep working."
msgstr ""
"Tá do theanga á hullmhú… Seans go dtógfaidh sé seo thart ar nóiméad an chéad"
" uair. Cuirfear í leis go huathoibríoch — is féidir leat leanúint ar aghaidh"
" ag obair."

#. %s: comma-separated list of language names.
msgid "Language ready and activated: %s"
msgstr "Tá an teanga réidh agus gníomhachtaithe: %s"

#. %s: comma-separated list of language names.
msgid "Could not prepare: %s. Please try again later."
msgstr "Níorbh fhéidir é a ullmhú: %s. Bain triail eile as níos déanaí."

msgid "Accessibility"
msgstr "Inrochtaineacht"

msgid ""
"Apply this design preset? It will overwrite your current Design settings "
"(you can still review before saving)."
msgstr ""
"An bhfuil tú ag iarraidh an réamhshocrú dearaidh seo a chur i bhfeidhm? "
"Forscríobhfaidh sé do shocruithe Dearaidh reatha (is féidir leat iad a "
"athbhreithniú fós sula sábhálfaidh tú)."

msgid "Calm, low-contrast palette in a rounded corner box."
msgstr "Pailéad socair, ísealchodarsnachta i mbosca le coirnéil chruinne."

msgid "Centered dialog with a dimmed overlay, dark theme."
msgstr "Dialóg lárnaithe le forleagan maolaithe, téama dorcha."

msgid "Colours meet WCAG AA accessibility"
msgstr "Comhlíonann na dathanna caighdeáin inrochtaineachta WCAG AA"

msgid "Design presets"
msgstr "Réamhshocruithe dearaidh"

msgid "Details"
msgstr "Mionsonraí"

msgid "Full-width bar at the bottom, light and neutral."
msgstr "Barra lánleithid ag bun an leathanaigh, éadrom agus neodrach."

msgid "Hide details"
msgstr "Folaigh na mionsonraí"

msgid ""
"One-click starting points. Applying a preset fills the Design fields below "
"and updates the live preview — review it, then Save Changes to keep it."
msgstr ""
"Pointí tosaigh le haon chliceáil. Nuair a chuirtear réamhshocrú i bhfeidhm, "
"líontar na réimsí Dearaidh thíos agus nuashonraítear an réamhamharc beo — "
"athbhreithnigh é, ansin roghnaigh Sábháil na hAthruithe chun é a choinneáil."

msgid "Preset applied. Review the preview, then Save Changes to keep it."
msgstr ""
"Cuireadh an réamhshocrú i bhfeidhm. Athbhreithnigh an réamhamharc, ansin "
"roghnaigh Sábháil na hAthruithe chun é a choinneáil."

msgid "Preview device width"
msgstr "Leithead an ghléis sa réamhamharc"

msgid "Slim, square bar pinned to the top of the page."
msgstr ""
"Barra caol, le coirnéil chearnacha, greamaithe de bharr an leathanaigh."

msgid "Soft floating card in the bottom-right corner."
msgstr "Cárta bog ar snámh sa chúinne íochtarach ar dheis."

msgid "Some colours have low contrast (%s) — see details."
msgstr "Tá codarsnacht íseal ag roinnt dathanna (%s) — féach na sonraí."
